# Contact Form Delivery Service Configuration
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Choose ONE of the following services to receive contact messages in your email inbox:
#
# Option A: Web3Forms (Recommended - Free, instant setup, no server needed)
# 1. Visit https://web3forms.com
# 2. Enter your email address (e.g. igalmoha0@gmail.com)
# 3. Paste the access key you receive below:
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here

# Option B: Formspree (Alternative)
# 1. Create a free form at https://formspree.io
# 2. Paste your form ID below:
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=your_formspree_id_here
